     "text": "{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"The target is not reachable. crownData:exfiltrate is an OR of vaultRead, codeRepo, shareMount and dbReplica, and every route is cut. (1) codeRepo:collection is blocked directly. (2) shareMount:collection depends only on backupHost:lateralMovement, which is blocked. (3) dbReplica:collection needs serviceAccount, domainAdmin or monitoringHost. serviceAccount is an AND that needs vpnSession:authenticate, and vpnSession is an AND that needs the blocked ciRunner:exploitPublicApp. domainAdmin is an AND that needs dbLogin:authenticate, which in turn needs the blocked browserStore:credentialAccess (it also needs apiToken, which needs ciRunner). monitoringHost depends only on rdpLogin:authenticate, an AND that needs browserStore, which is blocked. (4) vaultRead:collection depends only on domainAdmin or serviceAccount, both already shown unreachable.\"}"
    }
